---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services | Hesson Plumbing & Drains" description="Full-service plumbing solutions across Central Ohio. Drain cleaning, water heaters, sewer services, emergency plumbing and more. Call (740) 304-4195.">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__photo"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__noise"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__glow"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__glow page-hero__glow--left"></div>

    <div class="container page-hero__inner">

      <div class="page-hero__headline">
        <h1>Our<br /><span>Services</span></h1>
        <p class="page-hero__sub">From routine maintenance to full emergency response. We handle every plumbing need across Central Ohio with 25+ years of expertise.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA ROW -->
      <div class="page-hero__cta-row">
        <a href="tel:7403044195" class="btn-primary page-hero__btn">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13.1a19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 3.6 2.22h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6.06 6.06l.93-.93a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 21.72 17z"/></svg>
          Call Now
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost">Request Service</a>
        <div class="page-hero__trust">
          <span>✓ Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span>✓ Financing Available</span>
          <span>✓ Central Ohio</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CARDS ROW -->
      <div class="page-hero__cards">
        <div class="page-hero__card page-hero__card--years">
          <span class="page-hero__card-num" data-target="25" data-suffix="+">0+</span>
          <span class="page-hero__card-label">Years<br />Experience</span>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero__card page-hero__card--emergency">
          <div class="page-hero__card-dot"></div>
          <p class="page-hero__card-title">Emergency Line</p>
          <a href="tel:7403044195" class="page-hero__card-phone">(740) 304-4195</a>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero__card page-hero__card--available">
          <span class="page-hero__card-big">24/7</span>
          <span class="page-hero__card-small">Available Now</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES INTRO -->
  <section class="svc-intro">
    <div class="container svc-intro__inner">
      <div class="svc-intro__text reveal-left">
        <p class="eyebrow">Full-Service Plumbing</p>
        <h2>Everything Your<br /><span>Home Needs.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-intro__body reveal-right">
        <p>Whether it's a clogged drain at midnight or a sewer line that's been giving you trouble for years, Hesson Plumbing &amp; Drains handles it all. With over 20 years serving Central Ohio, we've built our reputation on showing up fast, diagnosing the problem right the first time, and getting the job done without the runaround. No upselling. No surprises on the bill. Just experienced plumbers who take pride in their work and treat your home like their own.</p>
        <div class="svc-intro__stats">
          <div class="svc-intro__stat">
            <span class="svc-intro__stat-num">20+</span>
            <span class="svc-intro__stat-label">Years Experience</span>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-intro__stat">
            <span class="svc-intro__stat-num">24/7</span>
            <span class="svc-intro__stat-label">Emergency Service</span>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-intro__stat">
            <span class="svc-intro__stat-num">15+</span>
            <span class="svc-intro__stat-label">Services Offered</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SEWER & DRAINS — video background section -->
  <section class="sewer-section">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline class="sewer-section__video">
      <source src="/drain-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <div class="sewer-section__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container sewer-section__inner">
      <div class="svc-category reveal">
        <h2 class="svc-category__title">Sewer &amp; Drains</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="sewer-grid">

        <div class="sewer-card reveal">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">01</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Drain Cleaning</h3>
          <p>Clogged or slow drains? We locate and clear blockages caused by grease, hair, soap buildup, and debris. Fast. Same-day service available across Central Ohio.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Kitchen &amp; bathroom drain clearing</li>
            <li>Preventative maintenance cleaning</li>
            <li>Same-day service available</li>
            <li>Residential &amp; commercial</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/drain-cleaning" class="sewer-card__cta">Learn More &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">02</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Camera Inspections</h3>
          <p>We send a camera down your pipes to see exactly what's going on. No guessing, no unnecessary digging. Know the problem before we fix it.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Video pipe inspection</li>
            <li>Root intrusion detection</li>
            <li>Accurate diagnosis before repair</li>
            <li>Sewer &amp; drain lines</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">03</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Hydro Jetting</h3>
          <p>High-pressure water jetting blasts through the toughest clogs and buildup including grease, scale, and roots. It leaves your pipes clean from the inside out.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>High-pressure water cleaning</li>
            <li>Removes grease, scale &amp; roots</li>
            <li>Restores full pipe flow</li>
            <li>Safe for most pipe types</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">04</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Sewer Inspections</h3>
          <p>Before buying a home or after a backup, a sewer inspection tells you exactly what's underground. We give you a clear picture and honest recommendations.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Pre-purchase sewer inspections</li>
            <li>Post-backup diagnostics</li>
            <li>Full video report</li>
            <li>Licensed &amp; insured</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">05</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Trenchless Repair</h3>
          <p>Fix broken sewer lines without tearing up your yard. Trenchless technology means less mess, less time, and less disruption to your property.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>No-dig pipe repair</li>
            <li>Pipe lining &amp; bursting</li>
            <li>Minimal property disruption</li>
            <li>Cost-effective alternative to excavation</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">06</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Pipe Descaling</h3>
          <p>Mineral buildup inside your pipes restricts water flow and causes damage over time. We remove scale buildup to restore flow and extend the life of your pipes.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Removes mineral &amp; calcium buildup</li>
            <li>Restores water pressure</li>
            <li>Extends pipe lifespan</li>
            <li>Older home pipe restoration</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EMERGENCY SERVICES -->
  <section class="emergency-section reveal">
    <div class="emergency-section__glow"></div>
    <div class="container emergency-section__inner">
      <div class="emergency-section__left">
        <div class="emergency-section__live">
          <span class="emergency-section__dot"></span>
          <span>Available Now</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="emergency-section__title">24/7 Emergency<br /><span>Services</span></h2>
        <p>Burst pipe at 2am? Sewer backup on a Sunday? Plumbing emergencies don't keep business hours, and neither do we. Call us any time and we'll be there fast.</p>
        <ul class="emergency-section__list">
          <li>Available 24 hours, 7 days a week</li>
          <li>Fast response across Central Ohio</li>
          <li>Upfront pricing, no surprises</li>
          <li>Financing available</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="emergency-section__right">
        <a href="tel:7403044195" class="emergency-section__call">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13.1a19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 3.6 2.22h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6.06 6.06l.93-.93a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 21.72 17z"/></svg>
          (740) 304-4195
        </a>
        <p class="emergency-section__sub">Call anytime — we answer 24/7</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost">Request Service Online</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PLUMBING — video background section -->
  <section class="plumbing-section">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline class="plumbing-section__video">
      <source src="/services-bg.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <div class="plumbing-section__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container plumbing-section__inner">
      <div class="svc-category reveal">
        <h2 class="svc-category__title plumbing-title">Plumbing</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="sewer-grid">

        <div class="sewer-card reveal">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">07</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Toilet Repair &amp; Replacement</h3>
          <p>Running, leaking, or won't flush? We repair and replace toilets of all makes and models, leaving your bathroom clean and working properly.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Running &amp; leaking toilet repair</li>
            <li>Full toilet replacement</li>
            <li>Flush mechanism repair</li>
            <li>Wax ring &amp; seal replacement</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">08</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Faucet Repair &amp; Replacement</h3>
          <p>Dripping faucets waste water and money. We repair and replace indoor and outdoor faucets quickly, with clean work and no mess left behind.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Kitchen &amp; bathroom faucet repair</li>
            <li>Outdoor spigot installation &amp; repair</li>
            <li>Fixture upgrades &amp; replacements</li>
            <li>Leak detection at the source</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">09</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Tankless Water Heaters</h3>
          <p>Get hot water on demand and stop paying to heat water you're not using. We install and service tankless water heaters for maximum efficiency.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Tankless water heater installation</li>
            <li>Repair &amp; maintenance</li>
            <li>Energy efficiency upgrades</li>
            <li>All major brands serviced</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">10</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Water Heaters</h3>
          <p>No hot water? Strange noises? We repair and replace traditional tank water heaters fast and get your hot water back up and running.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Tank water heater repair</li>
            <li>Full replacement &amp; installation</li>
            <li>Temperature &amp; efficiency diagnostics</li>
            <li>Same-day service when available</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">11</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Disposals</h3>
          <p>Noisy, leaking, or completely stopped? We repair and replace garbage disposal units quickly so your kitchen gets back to normal.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Garbage disposal repair</li>
            <li>Full unit replacement</li>
            <li>Noise &amp; leak diagnosis</li>
            <li>New installation</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">12</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Water Treatments</h3>
          <p>Hard water, bad taste, or water quality concerns? We install water treatment and filtration systems to give you clean, safe water throughout your home.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Water softener installation</li>
            <li>Whole-home filtration systems</li>
            <li>Water quality testing</li>
            <li>Reverse osmosis systems</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">13</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Pipe Leak Repairs</h3>
          <p>A leaking pipe can cause serious damage fast. We locate and repair leaks quickly to protect your home and prevent water damage from getting worse.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Leak detection &amp; diagnosis</li>
            <li>Pipe repair &amp; replacement</li>
            <li>Burst pipe emergency response</li>
            <li>Water damage prevention</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sewer-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="sewer-card__num">14</div>
          <h3 class="sewer-card__title">Sump Pumps &amp; Battery Backup</h3>
          <p>Protect your basement from flooding. We install and service sump pumps and battery backup systems to keep your home dry, even when the power goes out.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Sump pump installation &amp; repair</li>
            <li>Battery backup system installation</li>
            <li>Seasonal inspection &amp; testing</li>
            <li>Full replacement when needed</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="sewer-card__cta">Request Service &rarr;</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINANCING BANNER -->
  <section class="financing reveal" id="financing">
    <div class="container financing__inner">
      <div class="financing__text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Flexible Options</p>
        <h2>Financing Available</h2>
        <p>Don't let cost stop you from getting the plumbing service you need. We've partnered with Wisetack to offer simple, flexible financing — check your options with no impact to your credit score.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="https://www.wisetack.com/calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary">Click Here for More Details</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="cta-banner__photo"></div>
    <div class="cta-banner__bg"></div>
    <div class="container cta-banner__inner">
      <div class="cta-banner__text reveal-left">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ready to Get Started?</p>
        <h2>Get the Job<br /><span>Done Right.</span></h2>
        <p>Call or request service online. We'll get back to you fast.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-banner__actions reveal-right">
        <a href="tel:7403044195" class="btn-primary cta-banner__btn">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13.1a19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 3.6 2.22h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6.06 6.06l.93-.93a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 21.72 17z"/></svg>
          Call (740) 304-4195
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost">Request Service</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* DROP SHADOWS ON ALL TITLES */
  h1, h2, h3 {
    text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  }

  .page-hero {
    background: var(--black);
    min-height: 62vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .page-hero__photo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/hero-2.jpg');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 100%;
    opacity: 0.18;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .page-hero__noise {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.03'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    opacity: 0.4;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .page-hero__glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px; right: -200px;
    width: 800px; height: 800px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(15,54,125,0.35) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .page-hero__glow--left {
    top: auto; right: auto;
    bottom: -150px; left: -100px;
    width: 500px; height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(15,54,125,0.2) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .page-hero__inner {
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    padding: 80px 0 120px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .page-hero__headline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(120px, 18vw, 240px);
    line-height: 0.88;
    color: var(--white);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40px);
    animation: heroLine 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.1s forwards;
  }

  .page-hero h1 span {
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 3px var(--blue-light);
    display: block;
    text-shadow: none;
  }

  .page-hero__sub {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--grey);
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: heroLine 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.35s forwards;
  }

  @keyframes heroLine {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* CTA row */
  .page-hero__cta-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: heroLine 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.55s forwards;
  }

  .page-hero__btn { font-size: 14px; padding: 14px 28px; }

  .page-hero__trust {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .page-hero__trust span {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--grey);
  }

  .page-hero__trust span::first-letter { color: var(--blue-light); }

  /* Cards row */
  .page-hero__cards {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: heroLine 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.75s forwards;
  }

  .page-hero__card {
    background: rgba(10,30,80,0.45);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-blue);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 28px 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 160px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }

  .page-hero__card:hover {
    background: rgba(15,54,125,0.7);
    border-color: var(--blue-light);
  }

  .page-hero__card--years {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .page-hero__card-num {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 60px;
    color: var(--blue-light);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .page-hero__card-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .page-hero__card-dot {
    width: 8px; height: 8px;
    background: #22c55e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,0.25);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,0.25); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(34,197,94,0.08); }
  }

  .page-hero__card-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  }

  .page-hero__card-phone {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--white);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .page-hero__card-phone:hover { color: var(--blue-light); }

  .page-hero__card--emergency {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero__card--available {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .page-hero__card-big {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 52px;
    color: var(--blue-light);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .page-hero__card-small {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  }

  /* CATEGORY HEADERS */
  .svc-category {
    padding: 56px 0 8px;
